//   slot: Oregon starts Finney, Obidegwu and Offord; Finney is on PFF's top-10 returning corners (missed two games)
//   slot: Miami starts Fitzgerald at safety (moved to corner for stretches when injuries hit); Thorpe semifinalist, 2025 freshman All-American with 6 INTs
//   Jaylen Lewis (WKU S1): speed 9. named to Bruce Feldman's 2026 Freaks List
